<ul>
<li>XT 8086-8088</li>
<li>AT 286,AT 386, AT 486</li>
<li>Pentium I: AT 80586 dengan 50 Mhz, 70 Mhz, 90 Mhz, 100 Mhz, 133 Mhz.</li>
<li>Pentium II: 266 Mhz, 300 Mhz, 350 Mhz, 400 Mhz, 450 Mhz.</li>
<li>Pentium III: 500 Mhz, 550 Mhz, 600 Mhz, 650 Mhz, 700 Mhz.</li>
